B.pt=new A.bt(B.pN,["Domov","O n\xe1s","Menu","Gal\xe9ria","Kontakt","Life is Better at the Beach","Jedlo, n\xe1poje, hudba a dobr\xe1 n\xe1lada priamo pri vode. Za\u017eite to najlep\u0161ie z v\xedkendu \u2014 ka\u017ed\xfd de\u0148.","OTV\xc1RAME 29.05.2026","Pozri menu","Zisti viac","O n\xe1s","V\xe1\u0161 ob\u013e\xfaben\xfd k\xfat pri vode","Lost Weekend Bufet je miesto, kde \u010das spomal\xed a v\xedkend nikdy nekon\u010d\xed. N\xe1jdete n\xe1s priamo pri Zlat\xfdch pieskoch v Bratislave \u2014 s v\xfdh\u013eadom na vodu, pr\xedjemnou atmosf\xe9rou a chutn\xfdm jedlom.\n\nPripravili sme pre v\xe1s pestr\xfd v\xfdber \u0161peci\xe1lnych jed\xe1l, \u010derstv\xfdch n\xe1pojov a nekompromisn\xe9ho beach vibes. Vonkaj\u0161ie sedenie, letn\xe9 hitovky v pozad\xed a t\xedm, ktor\xfd sa postar\xe1, aby v\xe1\u0161 pobyt bol nezabudnute\u013en\xfd.","Vonkaj\u0161ie sedenie","V\xfdborn\xe9 jedlo","Good Vibes","Menu","Dobr\xe9 jedlo, skvel\xe1 atmosf\xe9ra","Jedlo","N\xe1poje","\u0160peciality","Jedlo","N\xe1poje","\u20ac","Zobrazi\u0165 alerg\xe9ny","Skry\u0165 alerg\xe9ny","Niektor\xe9 jedl\xe1 z na\u0161ej ponuky m\xf4\u017eu obsahova\u0165 alerg\xe9ny alebo v\xfdrobky z nich.","Gal\xe9ria","Atmosf\xe9ra, ktor\xfa mus\xed\u0161 za\u017ei\u0165","Fotky \u010doskoro","Kontakt","N\xe1jdite n\xe1s","Adresa","Telef\xf3n","E-mail","Otv\xe1racie hodiny","Otvori\u0165 v Google Map\xe1ch","Facebook str\xe1nka","\xa9 2026 Lost Weekend Bufet. V\u0161etky pr\xe1va vyhraden\xe9.","S l\xe1skou vyroben\xe9 pre Zlat\xe9 piesky"],t.li)
