B.Ft=new A.bt(B.pN,["Home","About","Menu","Gallery","Contact","Life is Better at the Beach","Food, drinks, music and good vibes right by the water. Experience the best of every weekend \u2014 every day.","OPENING 29.05.2026","See the menu","Discover more","About","Your favourite spot by the water","Lost Weekend Bufet is a place where time slows down and the weekend never ends. You'll find us right at Zlat\xe9 piesky in Bratislava \u2014 with a water view, a great atmosphere and delicious food.\n\nWe've prepared a wide selection of specialty dishes, fresh drinks and uncompromising beach vibes. Outdoor seating, summer hits in the background and a team that will make sure your visit is unforgettable.","Outdoor seating","V\xfdborn\xe9 jedlo","Good Vibes","Menu","Good food, great atmosphere","Food","Drinks","Specials","Food","Drinks","\u20ac","Show allergens","Hide allergens","Some meals may contain allergens or products thereof.","Gallery","An atmosphere you have to experience","Photos coming soon","Contact","Find us","Address","Phone","E-mail","Opening hours","Open in Google Maps","Facebook page","\xa9 2026 Lost Weekend Bufet. All rights reserved.","Made with love for Zlat\xe9 piesky"],t.li)
